      "text": "product_main.py\n\n0. init (env, config, log, temp, etc.)\n1. ingest.py -> temp dir\n2. transform.py -> temp dir\n3. init dcpy env\n3.1 apply metadata -> temp dir\n4. init arcpy env\n4.1 package.py -> final dir\n5. cleanup.py",
